# Keep the Rust manifest/lock files LF on every platform. The version-sync step and its
# drift-guard test match the crate entry across a newline; a CRLF checkout (Windows with
# core.autocrlf) would otherwise break both. Pinning eol here makes the checkout stable
# regardless of the contributor's git line-ending settings.
src-tauri/Cargo.lock text eol=lf
src-tauri/Cargo.toml text eol=lf
